{
  "info": {
    "name": "Transporte Escolar — API (2026-06-26)",
    "description": "Collection completa da API do sistema de transporte escolar.\n\nComo usar:\n1. Importe esta collection\n2. Execute **Auth / Login (Admin)** — o token JWT é salvo automaticamente em {{token}}\n3. As demais requisições usam o token automaticamente via Bearer Auth\n\nBase URL configurada como variável de collection {{base_url}}.\n\nStatus dos serviços (26/06/2026):\n✅ Auth-service — login e criação de admins funcionando\n✅ Relatorio-service — métricas e sync funcionando\n⚠️  Register-ADM — 500 (ClassCastException Long→UUID no banco)\n⚠️  Presença-service — 404/500 (UUID/Long mismatch; CursoController sem handler)\n⚠️  Route-generator — DTO binding issue na versão atual deployada",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "https://api-gateway.gentlemushroom-414bf899.brazilsouth.azurecontainerapps.io", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "aluno_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "curso_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "presenca_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rota_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "relatorio_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "auth-service — porta 8081. Todas as rotas sob /api/auth/**",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin) ✅",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', res.userId || '');",
                  "  console.log('Token salvo. userId:', res.userId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@local.test\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Usuário Comum) ✅",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
